No elevator, escalator, lift, dumb waiter and dock lift shall be operated in the village without obtaining and prominently displaying a certificate of compliance to all provisions of the documents adopted by reference herein, issued within the previous 365 days. The office of the village clerk is hereby authorized, together with his duly appointed assistants, to conduct annual inspections of any and all elevators, escalators, lifts, dumb waiters and dock lifts and to issue a certificate of compliance if said equipment is found to be in conformance of all the requirements of the documents adopted by reference herein. The fees required to be paid for the annual inspections of said equipment shall be as follows:

(1)

Inspections for public passenger elevators twice a year, $80.00 each inspection;

(2)

Inspection for public escalators twice a year, $80.00 each inspection;

(3)

Inspection for commercial freight elevators once a year, $80.00;

(4)

Inspection for commercial dumb waiters once a year, $80.00;

(5)

Inspection for dock lifts once a year, $80.00;

(6)

Residential inspection of individual handicapped elevators or lifts once a year, no fee.
